      "writtenOn": "2016-12-28T18:11:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why expose HwBinderDeathRecipientList if we don\u0027t expose HwBinderDeathRecipient? That means the only method we can actually use is lock() and find. And, we can\u0027t use the results from find either. Why not just expose getDeathLock instead of getDeathRecipientList in JHwRemoteBinder and move this class definition to the cpp?",
