      "message": "I exposed the class because sp\u003cclass\u003e needs a full definition of class - it can\u0027t do with a forward declaration.\n\ngetDeathRecipientList() is needed because, when you enter from Java, all you have is a pointer to the native context (a JHwRemoteBinder object), and you need a way to get at the death recipient list from there.",
